 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Everyone knows, the law of the king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever goes in to him uncalled shall die",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless he holds out the golden scepter",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I have not been called these thirty days",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 3.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not think that in the king's palace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You will escape more than all the Jews",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For if you keep silent at this time",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Relief will rise from another place",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And who knows whether you have come",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To the kingdom for such a time as this",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who knows, who knows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 2.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For such a time as this",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Go, gather all the Jews in Susa",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fast for me, three days, night or day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I will go to the king, though it is against the law",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And if I perish, I perish",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
